  "name": "Wall of Fire",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A wall (up to 60 ft long) or ring (up to 20 ft across) of fire, 20 ft high and 1 ft thick. Creatures in it when it appears make a DEX save: 5d8 Fire, half on a success. A creature that enters the wall or ends its turn in it takes 5d8 Fire (rolled automatically). Creatures ending their turn within 10 ft of the burning side take it too (the DM applies that). +1d8 per slot level above 4th.</p>",
